WowVision addons for WoW: Forever

The MIT licence in the file LICENSE covers what was written for this repository.

A few addons here adapt parts of the code of WowVision
(https://github.com/wow-vision/WowVision), for example the pet training window,
which follows WowVision's own trainer window. WowVision declares no licence: the
parts taken from it stay under whatever terms its authors give, and are not
relicensed by this repository.

Several of these addons were sent to WowVision as pull requests and merged
there (wow-vision/WowVision#112, #113, #114 and #121).

